WEBVTT

00:00:00.102 --> 00:00:01.508
Which refrigeration units

00:00:01.508 --> 00:00:02.900
does a store operate?

00:00:04.252 --> 00:00:06.205
Model Store and Refrigeration Unit

00:00:06.205 --> 00:00:07.454
as entity types:

00:00:07.468 --> 00:00:10.279
reusable definitions of business concepts.

00:00:11.618 --> 00:00:13.428
Region and priority are properties

00:00:13.428 --> 00:00:14.820
that describe a store.

00:00:16.152 --> 00:00:18.156
Name the relationship operates.

00:00:18.836 --> 00:00:20.477
In Microsoft’s example,

00:00:20.477 --> 00:00:21.844
the store’s Location ID

00:00:21.844 --> 00:00:23.783
matches the unit’s Store ID.

00:00:25.126 --> 00:00:27.066
Data bindings map the definitions

00:00:27.066 --> 00:00:28.082
to their source tables

00:00:28.082 --> 00:00:29.226
in a lakehouse.

00:00:30.572 --> 00:00:33.033
A consuming application uses these mappings

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:34.594
to query the sources.

00:00:35.275 --> 00:00:37.552
The ontology defines the connection;

00:00:37.553 --> 00:00:38.530
source records stay

00:00:38.530 --> 00:00:40.078
in their owning systems.
